      "text": "AMERICAN MATHEMATICAL SOCIETY S 0894-0347(08)00618-8 — 24 sections: Front matter; Introduction; A plethora of negative dependence\n\n**AMERICAN MATHEMATICAL SOCIETY S 0894-0347(08)00618-8**\n\n*Article electronically published on September 19, 2008*\n\n47 pp, 24 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 Introduction; 2 A plethora of negative dependence properties; 2.1 Negative dependence concepts; 2.2 Strongly Rayleigh measures; 2.3 Symmetric homogenization; 2.4 Measures on countably infinite sets; 2.5 Towards a theory of negative dependence: P; 3 Negative dependence in mathematics and physi; 3.1 Real stable polynomials and transcendental; 3.2 Hadamard-Fischer inequalities and GKK-matr; 3.3 Determinantal probability measures; 3.4 Graphs, Laplacians, spanning trees and the; 3.5 Interacting particle systems and exclusion; 4 Negative dependence theory for strongly Rayl; 4.1 Symmetric homogenization via Gårding hyper; 4.2 Stability implies negative association; 4.3 Stochastic domination and truncations",
